<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36919" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαριθμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enumerate, count,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν στρατόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.59
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>reckon up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶν τὸ λυποῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.25
				</span></i>
			 W.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυριάδες ἐξηριθμήθησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.87
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>count out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. χρήματα</span>
			<i>pay in ready</i> money, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>recount,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινδύνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.66
				</span></i>
			:—later in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κατὰ μέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					5.72
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				44.48
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				Pass.
			 in med. sense, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.2.1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1410b2
			</span></i>.</div>
